  "limitations": "The archive tests do not run business commands through SDK S3 gates or qualify physical S3, power loss, zones or production performance. Node-owned archive scheduling, contiguous core archive proof settlement, durability strengthening, ambiguous SDK archive waits and global backlog/disk admission are unfinished MR-09 work. SDK S3 commands remain refused before private execution. Dependency bytes are explicitly supplied; committed Blob/effect closure enumeration remains MR-12. ArchiveRecoverySet restores a cell image only and grants no votes, membership, process identity, query readiness or leadership; MR-10 owns atomic snapshot install and authorized member recovery. Four ignored process child entry points are invoked by owning parents and excluded from counts. Archive orphan GC, operations/release/scaling and MR-10 through MR-17 remain open; no complete-goal claim.",
